"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
134,"Muhammad bin Bashar told us, Abdul Rahman bin Mahdi told us. H and us Yusuf bin Musa, Waki’ told us, they said: Sufyan told us. H Muhammad bin Bashar told us, Yazid bin Harun told us, Mis’ar told us, Ali bin Khashram told us, Ali, meaning Ibn Yunus, told us On the authority of Mas'ar, both of them, on the authority of Al-Miqdam ibn Shurayh, on the authority of his father, he said: I said to Aisha: ""What was the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace? When he enters the house, he begins with the siwak. And Joseph said: When he entered his house"
